          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we factor out the constant <span class=\"math\">[MATH: -6.]</span> Then, we integrate the exponential function, and get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\eqalign{\n\\int (-6)7^x  \\, \\textrm d x\n&amp;= -6\\int 7^x\\,\\textrm{d}x\\\n&amp;=-6 \\cdot \\dfrac{7^x}{\\ln 7} + C.\n}]</span></p>",
