        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: \\displaystyle \\int -6(7^x) \\, \\textrm d x.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we factor out the constant [MATH: -6.] Then, we integrate the exponential function, and get\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n\\int (-6)7^x \\, \\textrm d x\n&= -6\\int 7^x\\,\\textrm{d}x\\\n&=-6 \\cdot \\dfrac{7^x}{\\ln 7} + C.\n}]"
