        "readable_text": "Prompt:\n[MATH: \u222b(2^{x} \u2212 10e^{x})dx =]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: (x)/(\\ln 2) + e^{10x} + C]\nb. [MATH: (2^{x})/(\\ln|x|) \u2212 10e^{x} + C]\nc. [MATH: (x \u2212 2)/(\\ln 2) \u2212 10e^{x} + C]\nd. [MATH: (x^{2})/(\\ln 2) \u2212 e^{x} + C]\ne. [MATH: (2^{x})/(\\ln 2) \u2212 10e^{x} + C]"
